    (Ψ a).symm (E a (v (Finset.univ.map a.toEmbedding) 0))
  refine ⟨Θ, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩
  ·
    intro q v v'
    funext a
    change (Ψ a).symm (E a ((v (Finset.univ.map a.toEmbedding) + v' (Finset.univ.map a.toEmbedding)) 0))
      = (Ψ a).symm (E a (v (Finset.univ.map a.toEmbedding) 0)) +
